## Reference projects (method and structure, not code)

The following repositories were studied while designing this project. No code was
copied from them. They are listed for attribution and for readers who want to compare
approaches:

- `ikhlasulov-gb/open-rpm-web` (GPL-3.0) — adaptive testing flow, age-correction pattern,
  Series A reliability check.
- `Ksound22/iq-measurer` (MIT) — item-bank data structure and test layout.
- `Zburgers/OpenIQ` — research methodology only ("no fake precision", "no silent timing
  bonus", reporting theta with uncertainty).
- `iq-misc/rpm-iq-exam` — evaluated and rejected; see `PLAN.md`.

